--- match
Match User erin
    PubkeyAuthentication no
    PasswordAuthentication yes
    AuthenticationMethods password
Match Group cluster-users,instructors,students,sudo
    PasswordAuthentication yes
--- sudoers
%sudo ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL
%ops ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL
alice ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
heidi ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
--- limits
